[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15062.07, "timestamp": "04:11:02", "text": "おお。いいね。いいね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15064.91, "timestamp": "04:11:04", "text": "これは何ですか? を手に入れたいです。青"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15069.15, "timestamp": "04:11:09", "text": "そしてそれは空砲だ。待って。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15071.229, "timestamp": "04:11:11", "text": "わかった。ランク"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15087.469, "timestamp": "04:11:27", "text": "けれど。欲しい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15090.309, "timestamp": "04:11:30", "text": "食べ物。待って。サトウキビは食べられません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15102.99, "timestamp": "04:11:42", "text": "だから、私は落ち着かなければならない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15105.429, "timestamp": "04:11:45", "text": "正直に言うと、私は落ち着く必要がある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15108.229, "timestamp": "04:11:48", "text": "下。待って、いくつかあります"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15108.909, "timestamp": "04:11:48", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hello"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15110.95, "timestamp": "04:11:50", "text": "あそこにいるのは冒涜者たちだ。だから、もしかしたら私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15113.03, "timestamp": "04:11:53", "text": "苗木を手に入れましょう。作る 多分私は自分の"}]